  "details": "And no, I'm not talking about the cursor. I feel like gaming controller (dualshock, xbox, joycon, etc.) support being added to the Quick Menu would be very useful considering there could be some people like me with a vr headset but no working vr controllers. As of right now in VR, you can't even use the controller's cursor to navigate the Quick Menu, it's just not there at all. Although, the cursor being made to work in VR with a gaming controller could also work as a solution.",
